    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "My bad. Did I\u2014"
    seconds: 13.608
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "No, no, it\u2019s nothing important. Just, that plant\u2014"
    seconds: 16.626
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "Oooh, yeah. Straight to the incinerator. Brass\u2019s orders."
    seconds: 20.084
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
